,,0,0,0,code line all,ci = ; cn = _G.unicode.len(orgline.textşstripped:gsub(" ",""))Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Cadenza & Counter,,0,0,0,template noblank multi loop 5,!retime("syl",0+(j-1)*-50,250+(j-1)*50)!Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.40,Title,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:38.08,Title,,0,0,0,,Forces of RageDialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:37.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:07:00.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:40.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,Team LuffyDialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Inside Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:14:00.31,Captions,,0,0,0,,Pudding's RoomDialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:36.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna wait here?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,We're right in the middle of enemy territory.Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll wait!Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Pound said the people who took down a Sweet Commander...Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,... ended up being annihilated in the blink of an eyeDialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:02:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,by Big Mom's vengeful army that came along with a storm.Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,So the enemy will come...Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:05.68,Main,,0,0,0,,But Sanji-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji will come!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,So, I'll wait here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! My head has been completely trimmed...Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It was clear, but suddenly, dark clouds started gathering...Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, King Baum?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That mountain is Whole Cake Chateau, where Mama lives!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is angry-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this the power of one person?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:17.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Linlin is always accompanied by weather elements.Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:22.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop her when she gets mad.Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Prometheus-sama and Zeus-sama are running wild!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is... outraged!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Clear the way! The enraged army is passing through!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,An army to avenge Cracker-sama has been organized!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:56.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Move! Get out of the way!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Look how many there are!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:15.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're gonna go after Straw Hat to kill him.Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If I remember right, he said he'd be there waiting for you.Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it for him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:36.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! That's Bobbin the Disposer!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Amande the Mad Moiselle!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's Mont d'Or the Scribe!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much the total of their bounties is?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:01.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be here waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:08.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that captain won't be stupid enoughDialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,to not run away after seeing that battalion.Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,It started raining.Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,this is... syrup.Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let even syrup in my mouth!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't eat anything other than what Sanji cooks!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Mama! Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.95,Main,,0,0,0,,– Mama! – Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:16.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all being good?Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, mama!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Anana?Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The head chef won't let me use a knife. I wanna cut my stuffed animal.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:32.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Dolce, Dragée, go and borrow one for her.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Mama! Once Anana has a knife, she'll pop our balloons!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's bad! I'm gonna kill her someday!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:46.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't say those things, right, Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone has 100 to 200 people that they want to kill.Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Be nice to each other, my children.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:08:00.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have Big Sis Pudding's wedding tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you excited?Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You get to eat a delicious wedding cake.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Now let's meet!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The groom's family!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:19.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Door!Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you here, Germa 66.Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to be late.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:35.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Emperor Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We've had a little problem, but it should be okay now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:53.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pudding! There you are.Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late.Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've heard a lot about him.Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Your son's a cook, huh? He's perfect for Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:14.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter even if he's not.Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a political marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:23.45,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as you and I share mutual interests, that's all that matters, Judge!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it'd be nice if our children are happy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a nice wedding tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have tea.Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you be quiet?Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.64,0:10:59.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so noisy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.31,Main,,0,0,0,,S... Sanji-san...Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:31.69,Note,,0,0,0,,I NEED TO TALK TO YOU IN PRIVATE LATERDialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no-ju...Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no-ju!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How many... are there?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.11,0:12:29.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Please! Hide yourself at least!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay to get away from here just for a while!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji might come while I'm gone!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, back up a little!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Luffy! It's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you know whose territory we're in?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a big army...Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't beat it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.74,Main,,0,0,0,,We found Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I promised him...Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,... that I'd be here waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:53.64,Main,,0,0,650,,You led Luffy and the others to this island?Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:55.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:14:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I promised them that I'd bring Sanji-san to the southwest coast.Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:06.24,Main,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't keep my word, and now they're in danger because of me.Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I was wondering how they made it through the sea under so much surveillance.Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I understand. But...Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:22.73,Main,,0,0,0,,... I wouldn't have gone to the coast anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about the invitation, it'll be alright if I take the blame!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If you attend the wedding, that'll be it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Since Mama is so used to political marriages,Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,she puts bracelets on brides and grooms who are likely to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If you try to get off of the island with them...Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll explode.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:47.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mom has the key to them.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,To get that, I'd have to defeat the Big Mom Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:54.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Mama has already...Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:15:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's already made those arrangements, and besides...Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:06.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a single ally around me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though we're related by blood...Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what they've done.Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:28.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Did your real family hurt you like that?Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.99,Main,,0,0,0,,How could they...Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like I'm a failure to them, and they can't stand my existence.Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never even once thought that I was happy to be born royal.Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I set out to sea...Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,... to find a place I wasn't even sure existed.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,... if I resist the marriage,Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:07.61,Main,,0,0,0,,my friends and I will be all dead.Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that,Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:15.45,Main,,0,0,0,,they'll kill my real father in the East Blue, a man I'm deeply indebted to!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:20.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Wherever I look, I have no way out.Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I decided to stop resisting!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,On the condition that I accept this marriage,Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I want Big Mom to let my friends go.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,They're going after Luffy and the others.Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,My mother put you in such a difficult position!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:58.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:16:59.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Until 13 years ago, I was in hell.Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I just came right back there again.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:17.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I should be happy to have been away from here as long as 13 years.Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The people who let me polish my cooking skillsDialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,and the friends who I traveled with...Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:28.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm indebted to everyone that I met.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanna go away without hurting anyone.Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,My adventure ends here.Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cry. It makes me feel pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:18:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let your marriage with me be hell!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:16.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! What am I saying?! You're deeply suffering!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The unwanted marriage should be hell to you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.24,Main,,0,0,0,,How could I say such a thing when someone's in pain!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself! I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I've only known you for a short time! There's no way I can fill the hole in your heart!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:37.62,Main,,0,0,0,,In the first place, you didn't even say that you're gonna marry me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so...Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're my... salvation.Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san...Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm good enough for you...Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:27.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get married tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the damage.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Get down here!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention.Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:20:01.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that a girl like you could make such a big lightning strike.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The Famous Sword...Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.05,Main,,0,0,0,,... Shirauo.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.05,Note,,0,0,0,,IcefishDialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think-ju! We didn't mean to change sides!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Amande-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:06.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch...!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I-If you're going to kill me, d-do it quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's pointless killing someone quickly.Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I cut at the most painful and tormenting speed.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.93,0:21:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:41.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like he was fighting Big Bro Cracker all night!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The Chess Peacekeepers aren't that weak!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How could he tear them to pieces like trash!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the power of fresh cream's sweetness-fa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,When the sweet cream sweetens, your whole body will be burned-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no. That's not gonna happen, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.24,0:23:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this place?Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in...Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:29.30,Main,,0,0,0,,... the World of Books!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.32,0:23:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Get down!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.10,0:24:41.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.91,0:25:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,King Baum...Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.16,0:25:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I was wondering why the Chess Peacekeepers, who are Homies, couldn't fight like usual,Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.18,0:25:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,and how you guys could make it out of the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:33.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you have Mama's Vivre Card?Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.67,0:25:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It says "Lola."Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola?! Did you steal it from her?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:42.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, man! That runaway girl got killed?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,– Lola! – What were her last words?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like that! She's my friend! She gave it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell Mama that yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we were ordered to catch you guys alive.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.03,0:25:57.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.48,0:26:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that.Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Most of the Chess Peacekeepers have been beaten.Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.06,0:26:33.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll... wait... here...Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.31,0:26:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,For Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.11,0:26:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.51,0:27:08.52,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:27:12.54,0:27:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.33,0:27:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, really.Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.19,0:27:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,When it comes to reasonable deals, I'm a reasonable person!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.25,0:27:25.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll let all members of the Straw Hats,Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,who are your friends at this time, leave this island alive!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise.Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:39.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If you drop the idea of running away, and marry without resistance,Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:42.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll turn a blind eye to everything!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.39,0:27:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it! I'll make Pudding-chan happy at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so in love with my daughter! I'm glad!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.11,0:28:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The things that the Straw Hats have done to me are normally inexcusable.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.12,0:28:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They destroyed the Seducing Woods and took down one of our Sweet Commanders.Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.50,0:28:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, on Fishman Island, not only did they eat my candies...Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.87,0:28:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,... but they also picked a fight with me.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,But now, the top priority is you and Pudding's marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.21,0:28:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If things go well,Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,about this time tomorrow, I'll gain Germa's military strengthDialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,and we'll all have a delicious wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.82,0:28:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't run away, everything will turn out for the best, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.93,0:29:15.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It is said that...Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.94,0:29:21.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Treasure Repository inside of Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:29:15.94,0:29:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,... there are about 30 Poneglyphs, inscribed stone blocks...Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,... that have never broken for over hundreds of years...Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:28.66,Main,,0,0,0,,... which exist in the whole world-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.75,0:29:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,And only nine of those 30 Poneglyphs have specific kinds of information.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If you take those to the last island, Raftel,Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.62,0:29:49.05,Main,,0,0,0,,the stones will reveal the truth of this world-soir.Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.35,0:29:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't do it, Sweet Commander Smoothie-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.52,0:29:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.81,0:29:59.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me, Smoothie-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.24,0:30:11.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Smoothie-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But, in order to go to the last island Raftel, you need...Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.91,0:30:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,... four Road Poneglyphs, the red stones!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.67,0:30:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Including the one delivered by Jinbe the other day...Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.47,0:30:32.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A present for you. I got it on my way here.Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.72,0:30:34.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's from me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.27,0:30:40.19,Main,,0,0,0,,... we Big Mom Pirates have two PoneglyphsDialogue: 0,0:30:40.19,0:30:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,and one Road Poneglyph.Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.19,0:30:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,That means three stones in total-vous plaît.Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.74,0:30:52.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how important those three stones are.Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.87,0:30:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.83,0:31:01.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,One of the Three Sweet Commanders of the Big Mom Pirates, Minister of JuiceDialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:31:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,... why did you suddenly tighten security now, Tamago?Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.20,0:31:03.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to do until the tea party.Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.83,0:31:06.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Smoothie – 14th Daughter of the Charlotte Family Bounty: 932 Million BellyDialogue: 0,0:31:03.66,0:31:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,So I don't mind guarding them.Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.84,0:31:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you-renaissance.Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.01,0:31:17.22,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a former pirate captain who came to this island about five years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,He is a Mink Poneglyph thief, and it seems that...Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:26.11,Main,,0,0,0,,he has snuck onto this island again-soufflé.Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.11,0:31:27.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.10,0:31:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,His life was spared because his compatriot Pekoms begged for his life.Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.22,0:31:35.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did he return?Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.20,0:31:39.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.50,0:31:49.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get all four red Road Poneglyphs, you can reach Raftel.Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, that's the road to become the King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a quest worthy of the Four Emperors-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.85,0:32:09.11,Main,,0,0,0,,For the sake of Mama, we put our lives on the line to protect these stones-chocolat!Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.99,0:32:18.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside of the Treasure Repository in the Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:32:22.21,0:32:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook.Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.46,0:32:29.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Spirits CellarDialogue: 0,0:32:29.05,0:32:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What? They increased security?Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.97,0:32:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, they were calling her Sweet Commander Smoothie.Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander... That means she's a top officer!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.93,0:32:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so. No wonder she looked strong.Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.98,0:32:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless. They now have perfect security.Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no chance even at night.Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.54,0:32:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Our last hope may have vanished when Tamago noticed I was here.Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:33:00.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others are having difficulty.Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.69,0:33:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if we could complete our mission smoothly.Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.42,0:33:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I was touched by what you said the other day.Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.89,0:33:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,In order for Luffy-san to becomeDialogue: 0,0:33:15.14,0:33:19.81,Main,,0,0,0,,the King of the Pirates, he'll need the Road Poneglyph someday.Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.81,0:33:24.81,Main,,0,0,0,,But it won't be so easy to come back here.Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.14,0:33:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Rather, we have to clash with them head-on if we really want to come back.Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.98,0:33:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think we all could make it this far again.Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.08,0:33:36.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.57,0:33:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Given this, maybe now is the rare chance.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.41,0:33:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But if we invade, both of us will get killed!Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.75,0:33:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is Baron Tamago's target?Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.64,0:33:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.51,0:34:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro-san,Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,would you be willing to serve as bait?Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.20,0:34:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I was thinking.Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:17.23,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Attack Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.26,0:00:02.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 1,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 2,0:00:02.65,0:00:03.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 1,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 2,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.14,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:00:03.14,0:00:03.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 2,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 1,0:00:01.83,0:00:03.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.28,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:01.87,0:00:03.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 2,0:00:03.98,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 2,0:00:04.31,0:00:04.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 1,0:00:01.95,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 2,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.99,0:00:04.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 2,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 1,0:00:02.03,0:00:05.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tteDialogue: 2,0:00:05.25,0:00:05.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,